  "detail_text": "** Due to NAVY OPSEC procedures, the vessel name has been redacted from the solicitation. If required to quote, please request the vessel name via email ** NAVSUP Fleet Logistics Center Puget Sound intends to solicit and award a firm-fixed-price Supply-type Purchase Order for Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM) Point Eight Power, LLC High Voltage Switchboard maintenance and repair on a Brand Name basis. See attached solicitation posted 13 Mar 2026 for requirements. All respones must be submitted prior to the solicitation closing date on page 1, box 8.",
